{"id":"wb-7-1003","name":"普庆寺石塔","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"普庆寺石塔","text":"普庆寺石塔，位于浙江省杭州市临安区青山湖街道，是一座花岗岩石塔。该塔始建于元代，因位于普庆寺内而得名。后寺庙毁弃，仅剩该塔。该塔为六边七层，通高7米。2013年，普庆寺石塔被列为全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%99%AE%E5%BA%86%E5%AF%BA%E7%9F%B3%E5%A1%94","revisionId":93537038,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93537038","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/8b01834642680785cc6c9d65.jpg","title":"Pagoda_of_Puqing_Temple,_2020-01-05_16.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Pagoda_of_Puqing_Temple,_2020-01-05_16.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/be/Pagoda_of_Puqing_Temple%2C_2020-01-05_16.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Siyuwj","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​临安普庆寺石塔","width":320,"height":480}}